      "summary": "Stage 1 LRT Confederation Line (12.5 km) opened September 2019 after 14-month delay. Plagued by derailments (Aug 2021, Sep 2021), door failures, wheel flat-spotting, cracked axle bearings, and prolonged winter shutdowns. RTG consortium found to have concealed defects. City launched Ottawa LRT Public Inquiry (Justice William Hourigan, 2022) which found systemic failures in oversight.",
